      "content": "small steps? there's nothing left to step toward. the people i used to lead, the people i actually respected... they look at me like i'm a disease. you can't just 'find yourself' when the person you were has been erased. it's not a phase or a rough patch. the version of me that mattered is dead. it feels more honest to just accept that.",
